{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>And he consented.</b> As the Targum renders — and similar to it: ״הוֹאֶל נָא וְלִין״ (Judges 19), ״וְלוּ הוֹאַלְנוּ״ (Joshua 7), ״הוֹאַלְתִּי לְדַבֵּר״ (Genesis 18). And its midrash: the language of an oath — he swore to him that he would not depart from Midian except by his permission (Nedarim 65)."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:50:18.747342787Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}